    "summary": "Qualify original M7-W01-C03-T1 by independently reconciling both accepted S01 pure DAG and S02 reciprocal PlotModel research families. Verify the four SHA-pinned predecessor T1/T2 receipts, exact diamond root 13/shared once and the 1/x four-point/two-segment no-bridge reference. Advance aggregate C03 and T1 Q/O/D only; retain prior runtime/renderer deferrals and leave T2, W01 and M7 unfinished.",
    "value": "A read-only BCL aggregate checker verifies exact source byte identities and independently recomputes the finite diamond and 1/x cross-family witnesses, with original size-L parent state checks. Document precise research quotas and Math/AURA owner boundaries. No graph engine, public PlotModel, renderer, package or sibling cutover is admitted.",
    "nextAction": "After durable RS115 success, prepare M7-W01-C03-T2: independently reconcile resource quotas, unknown-domain/partial/cancellation limits and owner-gated DAG/PlotModel deferrals, close original C03 as research only and then assess whether W01 can be completed before M7-W02.",
