      "Completed DAG and reciprocal BCL reference scripts are not product graph, plotting or AURA scheduling APIs.",
      "Finite research limits do not demonstrate generic topological/continuity proofs, numerical error guarantees or total memory budgets.",
      "C03 T2 must separately reconcile split evidence, source-free consumer gaps, execution/refusal policy and Math/AURA authority.",
      "No third-party provider source/license/RID, package-only consumer, public NuGet or external repository adoption is qualified.",
      "Original size-L C03, M7-W01 work package and M7 milestone must remain incomplete after RS115 T1."
    ],
